        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Palace of Versailles</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1623 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Begun as a hunting lodge for Louis XIII; expanded for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/louis-xiv">Louis XIV</a> by the architects Louis Le Vau, François d'Orbay and Jules Hardouin-Mansart, the painter Charles Le Brun and the garden designer André Le Nôtre, under the direction of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jean-baptiste-colbert">Jean-Baptiste Colbert</a></span></div>
